      "machineHash": "91cfe9c511235e5e4c2c2c8c7077549d814d202bc38d96ee0d5a31ef959fb042",
      "machineText": "`NewNotchWindow` requer `-tags private_mac_apis` para que o conteúdo web transparente revele o formato nativo do notch. Sem a tag, o painel, o posicionamento e as animações continuam funcionando, mas a webview permanece opaca. Consulte [APIs privadas do macOS](/guides/build/private-macos-apis/#webview-transparency-and-background).",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`NewNotchWindow` requires `-tags private_mac_apis` for transparent web content to reveal the native …",
